Content-Type: application/json

{
  "offerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "producibleItemId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "presentation": "300 g",
  "quantityPerUnit": 300,
  "measurementUnit": "Gram",
  "unitPrice": 24.90
}

### Substitua o ID pela configuração criada acima

POST {{Ts_Api_HostAddress}}/api/frozen-stock/production-entries
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: frozen-production-2026-09-04-01

{
  "frozenConfigurationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "manufacturedOn": "2026-09-04",
  "producedQuantity": 24,
  "actorId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

